OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer minibus drivers will see
OL,4,A'rewarding' role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community minibus service in Beverley
OL,7,Fis looking for volunteer drivers to
OL,8,Fhelp residents get out and about.
OL,10,FBeverley Community Lift helps older
OL,11,Fpeople, people with disabilities and
OL,12,Fresidents living in rural and isolated
OL,13,Fareas to go shopping, attend
OL,14,Fappointments and enjoy days out.
OL,16,FThe charity is running a taster session
OL,17,Fat Beverley Enterprise Centre on
OL,18,FSaturday from 09:00 until 12:00 BST for
OL,19,Fanyone interested in getting involved.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
