OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer minibus drivers will see
OL,4,A'rewarding' role
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Home, who became a volunteer
OL,7,Fafter attending a previous recruitment
OL,8,Fevent, said: "It's very rewarding
OL,9,Fknowing how much [the residents]
OL,10,Fappreciate the service and the time the
OL,11,Fvolunteers give."
